{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj49dAwTnk29S8NFzYoB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You feel cold iron beneath your fingers. The surface is ancient, pitted with age, covered in a thin layer of frost that burns where skin meets metal.*\n\n*A mechanism deep within groans — the sound of tumblers older than language shifting in their housings. Something clicks. Something else resists.*\n\n*The frost crawls up your wrist.*\n\n*A voice that is not a voice — more a vibration through the bones of the door and into the bones of your hand — reverberates:*\n\n**\"PARSED.\"**\n\n*The lock does not open. The lock* ***recognizes.***\n\n*There is a difference.*\n\n*The door holds still. Waiting. The cold deepens. Through the keyhole, a draft carries the scent of wet stone, old fire, and something underneath both — something alive, breathing in a rhythm that does not match yours.*\n\n*The tumblers hover between positions.*\n\n*What turns them is not a key.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":213,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}